---
import './Hero.css'
import HeroField from './HeroField.astro'
---

<section class="hero-act static" id="top">
  <HeroField />
  <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="主导航">
    <a class="brand" href="#top">
      <img class="brand-mark" src="/rabbit.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26" aria-hidden="true" />
      <span class="brand-name">
        <span>hackrabbit</span>
        <small>frontend operator</small>
      </span>
    </a>
    <div>
      <a href="#building">在做什么</a>
      <a href="#follow">关注</a>
      <a href="#work">作品</a>
      <a href="#skills">能力</a>
      <a href="#experience">经历</a>
      <a href="/writing/">写作</a>
      <a href="#contact">联系</a>
    </div>
  </nav>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow hero-reveal">前端工程师 · hackrabbit</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title hero-reveal">HACKRABBIT</h1>
      <img class="hero-brush" src="/brush.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="420" height="26" />
      {/* 首屏语序「现在 X。此前 4-5 年前端交付。」是决定 6 —— 语序本身编码优先级，
          X 走 B 口径（面向普通读者），技术可信度交给后半句兜住。 */}
      <p class="lead hero-reveal">
        现在，我在帮普通人看懂 <span class="nowrap">AI 时代</span>里和自己有关的变化。此前 4-5
        年前端交付。
      </p>
      {/* 自述：不露脸，用化身与语气立住「人」。风格对标站主喜欢的游戏/动漫（见 ORIENTAL-REDESIGN）。 */}
      <p class="hero-motto hero-reveal">
        白天拆需求，晚上拆排位。先看清地图，再动手。
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta hero-reveal">
        <a class="cta cta-primary" href="#building">在做什么 ↓</a>
        <a class="cta" href="https://github.com/hackrabbit6" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
          GitHub ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-mark hero-reveal">
      <img
        class="hero-avatar"
        src="/avatar.webp"
        alt="hackrabbit 的化身：一只深夜在台灯下敲代码的白兔"
        width="560"
        height="560"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
